BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] 1:1 Genealogy Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T163000
DTSTAMP:20260821T134432Z
UID:smcl-69374f086724c63d00e5ee31@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Are\n you ready to uncover the fascinating stories of your anc
 estors? Join us\n for personalized 30-minute genealogy sessions that will 
 ignite your \npassion for family history!  \n\n\n\nWhat Awaits You:  \nAnc
 estry Library Edition: Unlock billions of records and start weaving your f
 amily tree! HeritageHub: Dive into captivating tales about your ancestors 
 and your local history. HeritageQuest: Discover hidden gems like census re
 cords\, military documents\, and so much more!My China Roots: Explore your
  family history with My China Roots\, a Chinese genealogy website and data
 base.\nYour Journey Starts Here! Your\n suggested appointment date & time 
 are all TENTATIVE until you \nreceive an email confirmation. Whether you'r
 e a beginner or a seasoned \nresearcher\, our sessions are designed to hel
 p you uncover your unique \nstory. Reserve your spot now and embark on the
  adventure of discovering \nyour roots! \n\n \nREGISTER HERE\n\nAges: Adul
 t program (kids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRegistratio
 n: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69374f086724c63d00e
 5ee31\nLast synced: 2026-08-21 06:44 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69374f086724c63d00e5ee31
END:VEVENT
