 ake place on the first Thursday of the month.\n\n\nVisit our Cookbook Book
  Club Info Hub      to find out more! \n\nNo registration is required at t
 his time. This book club is for adults ages 18+.\n\nAges: Adult program (k
 ids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRegistration: none\nSou
